     1,
     "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Oi Igor,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Isso mesmo. Esta relação não será precisamente a mesma, mas algo\r\nmuito aproximado.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Esta simulação serve para dar uma noção sobre altura de voo. Dependendo\r\ndo seu objetivo, por exemplo, média de parcela (como o meu caso em melhoramento),\r\nvocê pode ter uma altura de voo maior (60m) e assim tirar menos fotos, usar\r\nmenos memória e fazer análises mais rápidas devido a menor resolução. Por outro\r\nlado, se o objeto é identificar detalhes como flores, doenças, contagem de\r\nobjetos, entre outros, o voo precisa ser mais próximo (maior resolução, 15m).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Boa sorte em seu trabalho e nos mantenha informado.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Abraço,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Filipe Matias<u></u><u></u></span></p></div><div><br></div>"
    ]
